You create a covering index: CREATE INDEX idx ON orders(customer_id, created_at, total_amount);

This index covers which query most efficiently?
A: SELECT total_amount FROM orders WHERE customer_id = 5 AND created_at > '2024-01-01';
B: SELECT customer_id FROM orders WHERE total_amount > 1000;
C: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer_id = 5;
